# 行尾统一（eng review S2-8）：仓库内一律 LF，消除 CRLF/LF 混杂
# （此前测试文件 CRLF 导致跨行精确替换静默失配，见 2026-09-25 会话记录）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 例外：shell 脚本必须 LF（原有规则保留）
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
